    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Discrete <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> with MLLMs for Unified Medical Multimodal Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mao%2C+J">Jiawei Mao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Y">Yuhan Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+L">Lifeng Chen</a>, 
      
