    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Drive&amp;Gen: Co-Evaluating End-to-End Driving and <span class="search-hit mathjax">Video</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+J">Jiahao Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+Z">Zhenpei Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bai%2C+Y">Yijing Bai</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Y">Yingwei Li</a>, 
      
