    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Generative <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modelling</span> for Humanoids: 1X <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Challenge Technical Report
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mereu%2C+R">Riccardo Mereu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Scannell%2C+A">Aidan Scannell</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hou%2C+Y">Yuxin Hou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+Y">Yi Zhao</a>, 
      
